  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The degree of dissociation of $\\mathrm{PCl}_{5}(\\alpha)$ obeying\r\n\r\nthe equilibrium $\\mathrm{PCl}_{5} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{PCl}_{3}+\\mathrm{Cl}_{2}$ is related to the equilibrium pressure by",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "EE0Hw",
      "text": "$\\alpha \\propto \\frac{1}{\\mathrm{P}^{4}}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jYCkg",
      "text": "$\\alpha \\propto \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\mathrm{P}}}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Tm3VA",
      "text": "$\\alpha \\propto \\frac{1}{\\mathrm{P}^{2}}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xlpmJ",
      "text": "$\\alpha \\propto \\mathrm{P}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/CH0qTfl1P3Qd2qDlQOHZysyowccoOImkNqBE-GV84UA.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{p}}=\\frac{\\frac{\\alpha}{1+\\alpha} \\mathrm{P} \\times \\frac{\\alpha}{1+\\alpha} \\mathrm{P}}{\\frac{1-\\alpha}{1+\\alpha} \\mathrm{P}}=\\frac{\\alpha^{2} \\mathrm{P}}{1-\\alpha^{2}}$\r\n\r\nor, $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{p}}=\\alpha^{2} \\mathrm{P}$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\alpha=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{p}}}{\\mathrm{P}}}$ when $1-\\alpha^{2}=1$",
    "image": null
  },
